{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36345","headline":"思桐庐旧居便送鉴上人 · 方干","name":"思桐庐旧居便送鉴上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫道东南路不赊，思归一步是天涯。\n林中夜半双台月，洲上春深九里花。\n绿树遶村含细雨，寒潮背郭卷平沙。\n闻师却到乡中去，爲我殷勤谢酒家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}